cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite the paper below and the pure-sector solutions of Lam, Chung & Yunes listed under references."
title: "Mixed-order sGB-dCS corrections to rotating black holes: code and data"
type: software
abstract: "Pseudospectral solver, mixed-order solutions for spins 0.1-0.9, and scripts that reproduce every observable, table and consistency check of the leading mixed-order O(zeta_GB zeta_CS) corrections to rotating black holes in combined scalar Gauss-Bonnet and dynamical Chern-Simons gravity (arXiv:2611.04945)."
keywords:
  - modified gravity
  - black holes
  - dynamical Chern-Simons gravity
  - scalar Gauss-Bonnet gravity
  - effective field theory
  - spectral methods
